  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Reports\">Reports</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Business Code Custom Customer FinancialStatements Is On Port Reports Statement Supplier Tax To ToDate\">The <code>Reports</code> tab provides comprehensive financial and operational reporting capabilities for your business. Access a wide range of standard reports including financial statements, tax reports, customer and supplier summaries, inventory analysis, and more.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Custom Customize Date Filter Find On Other Port Reports To ToDate\">Reports are organized into categories based on their function, making it easy to find the information you need. Each report can be customized with date ranges, filters, and other parameters to meet your specific requirements.</p><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Port Reports\">Standard Reports</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Business On Port Reports\">The system includes dozens of built-in reports covering all aspects of your business operations:</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Balance BalanceSheet CashFlowStatement Code Equity FinancialStatements On Position Profit ProfitAndLossStatement Statement StatementOfChangesInEquity\">Financial statements such as <code>Profit and Loss Statement</code>, <code>Balance Sheet</code>, <code>Cash Flow Statement</code>, and <code>Statement of Changes in Equity</code> provide a complete picture of your financial position and performance.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Action And Balance Code Count General_ledger GeneralLedgerSummary GeneralLedgerTransactions Off On Port Reports Summary To ToDate Transaction Transactions TrialBalance\">General ledger reports including <code>Trial Balance</code>, <code>General Ledger Summary</code>, and <code>General Ledger Transactions</code> offer detailed insights into your accounting records.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Assets Business Custom Customer Customers Fixed_asset FixedAsset FixedAssets Port Reports Supplier Suppliers Tax To ToDate\">Specialized reports for taxes, customers, suppliers, inventory, fixed assets, payroll, and more help you manage specific areas of your business effectively.</p><div class=\"border rounded p-0.5 inline-block pointer-events-none ltr:pr-8 rtl:pl-8\"><div class=\"bg-neutral-200 ltr:pl-8 rtl:pr-8\"><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div><div class=\"border-y ltr:border-l rtl:border-r border-neutral-300 bg-white p-4 flex gap-2 items-center\"><i class=\"fas fa-print text-neutral-400\"></i><span class=\"font-semibold text-sm text-[#428bca]\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Reports\">Reports</span></span></div><div class=\"border-x border-neutral-300 bg-neutral-100 h-2\"></div></div></div><h2 translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Custom CustomReport CustomReports Port Reports To ToDate\">Custom Reports</h2><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"AdvancedQueries And Business Code Create Custom CustomReport CustomReports On Port Reports To ToDate\">Beyond the standard reports, you can create custom reports using <code>Advanced Queries</code> to extract and analyze data in ways that are unique to your business needs.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"And Calculation Custom CustomReport CustomReports Exactly Filter From FromDate On Port Reports Required To ToDate\">Custom reports provide ultimate flexibility, allowing you to combine data from multiple sources, apply complex filters, perform calculations, and format results exactly as required.</p><ul><li translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Action Guides Is On Tax TaxTransactions Transaction Transactions\"><a href=\"guides/tax-transactions-list\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"TaxTransactions\">Tax Transactions</span></a></li><li translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Guides Is Summary Tax TaxSummary\"><a href=\"guides/tax-summary-list\"><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"TaxSummary\">Tax Summary</span></a></li><li translate=\"true\" keywords=\"G